    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.8rem);">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="page-body" style="line-height:1.75; font-size:1.02rem;">

<p><em>Last updated: 30 October 2026</em></p>
<p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device. This page explains which ones this site may set.</p>
<h2>Types of cookies</h2>
<p><strong>Strictly necessary.</strong> Used for basic site operation and security, for example by our hosting provider.</p>
<p><strong>Advertising.</strong> Google AdSense and its partners may set cookies to show and measure ads and, where permitted, to personalise them.</p>
<p><strong>Embedded content.</strong> Maps on place and event pages are provided by Google and may set cookies when they load.</p>
<p><strong>Partner links.</strong> If you follow a link to a booking partner, that partner may set its own cookies.</p>
<h2>Managing cookies</h2>
<p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, though some features may then work less well. To control personalised ads see <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Google Ads Settings</a>. Further detail is in our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>.</p>

    </div>
